Presenting - The Printer
What happened on the station? What happened to the station? Where are all people? Who are the Constructors?
Now, every time you arrive to the station, you will get a small portion of the plot!
Just grab the newspaper and check it out!


List of changes:

Lectern fix;
Stations remastered;
Plot makes more sense;
Added printer;
Added semitones;
Added "long" notes;
Dron is now not allowed to exit the station and fly around bathyscaphe;
Fixed small glitches and other fixes.


Our dev team is giving its best to enhance the game and we hope that you will enjoy the changes! If you want to take part in making Seabed Prelude better, please visit our Community Hub and share your thoughts!

Sincerly
Seabed Prelude Dev Team

